[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ルトガー！\u3000待ってよ！\u3000どこ行くの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger! Wait up! Where are you going!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ルト……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rut..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ルトガーの様子、普通じゃない。\n\u3000何が起きてるの……？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Something's not right with Rutger. What's happening to him...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんにちはー！\u3000誰かいるかなーっと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Helloooo! Anyone here?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こ、こんにちは。わっ、大勢いる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hello. Oh wow, there are so many people..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また会えましたね、ユミア、ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good to see you again, Yumia, Viktor."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プラフタさん。\nこの人たちが話してくれた二人なんですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are these the two you were telling us about, Plachta?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なになに？\u3000私も聞きたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, what's this about? Fill me in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "説明はアルビちゃんにお任せ。案内人っすから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave the explaining to me! I am the Star Guide, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほどな。そりゃ、厄介ごとが起きてるんだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. So that's the trouble you've run into."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでみんなに協力してもらえたらなーって思って、\nここに来たんだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why we came here, hoping everyone could lend us a hand."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "するする。すっごい魔物と戦うなんて楽しいからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Count me in! Fighting powerful monsters sounds like fun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わたしたちもお手伝いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll help too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。私たちはそのつもりでここに来ました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. That's why we came here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったぁ！\u3000心強い！\nそういえば、レスナはいないんだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Awesome! That's reassuring! Oh yeah, is Resna not around?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナなら別の用事があるらしくて、出かけてるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna's out on other business right now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このアトリエの持ち主で、イケイケの錬金術士なんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's the owner of this atelier and a super talented alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に、たくさんの錬金術士がいるんだな、\nこの世界には……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There really are so many alchemists in this world..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっぱり、不安ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you still worried?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。だが、別世界の人間の干渉は許されないだろう。\nこの世界には、この世界の常識がある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. But interference from people of other worlds shouldn't be allowed. This world has its own way of doing things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、そうそう！\u3000それで作戦なんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh right! About our strategy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ私たちとソフィーたちで、「青の領域」の調査を\n続けておけばいいのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So Sophie and the rest of us will keep investigating the blue zone?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユミアさんたちの仲間も、早く見つけ出したいですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And we should try to find Yumia's friends quickly too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お願いします！\u3000ただ、話した通り、\nあの場所にいた魔物はとても強いので……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please! Though like I mentioned, that monster we encountered is really strong..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "任せて！\u3000私、強さが売りの１つだから。\n腕が鳴るわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to me! Fighting's one of my specialties. I can't wait!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア、深追いはダメだからね？\nで、アタシたちは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria, don't get carried away, okay? As for us..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国で、あの魔物――ツォルンフルク\n討伐のための情報を探す。そうだな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll search Nova for information on defeating that monster—the Zornfluch. Is that right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし、頑張ろうね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, let's do our best!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]